{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.poster.avif?t=1756814895\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.webm?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.mp4?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern third person shooter combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Negative Agents, a horde of cybernetic creatures terrorizing the citizens of North Terrace. Their origin remains a mystery - but some speculate they have a connection to an alien race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.poster.avif?t=1756814895\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.webm?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.mp4?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the relationship drama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your therapist introduces you to Brunilda, a brilliant but haunted artist. That same day, Amelia Jalisco enters your life under strange circumstances. Between them begins a quiet battle for Evo\u2019s heart \u2014 one that pulls you into a world of obsession and secrecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.poster.avif?t=1756814895\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.webm?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.mp4?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a dying city.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-open world design allows you to drive between buildings and areas of the city. Use speed tunnels to fast track it across the world if you want avoid the THUGs and Kill-Mobiles roaming the streets.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: Play as a Evo, a jobless tech worker entangled in a surreal journey with Brunilda, the game designer whose projects have made her the target of a secret society. As her protector, you\u2019ll navigate a decaying city overrun by cybernetic enemies, fragmented memories, and shifting realities. The mysterious forces controlling North Terrace may be impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Puzzles </strong>\u2013 An additional layer of hidden puzzles will lead you to secret areas, narrative clues, and disturbing memories. Like a scavenger hunter, these puzzles can span the entire game world, and often require a deep level of attention to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1756814895","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1756814895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756814895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756814895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2379320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.poster.avif?t=1756814895\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.webm?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.mp4?t=1756814895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern third person shooter combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Negative Agents, a horde of cybernetic creatures terrorizing the citizens of North Terrace. Their origin remains a mystery - but some speculate they have a connection to an alien race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: