ess tech worker entangled in a surreal journey with Brunilda, the game designer whose projects have made her the target of a secret society. As her protector, you\u2019ll navigate a decaying city overrun by cybernetic enemies, fragmented memories, and shifting realities. The mysterious forces controlling North Terrace may be impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Puzzles </strong>\u2013 An additional layer of hidden puzzles will lead you to secret areas, narrative clues, and disturbing memories. Like a scavenger hunter, these puzzles can span the entire game world, and often require a deep level of attention to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Technical Fiction"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/header.jpg?t=1756814895","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Technical Fiction. All trademarks and service marks are the property of Technical Fiction or its licensors.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191188,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191188/movie480.mp4?t=1756597061","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto